/E (The Premier Card is built for the 4 days a year our members travel not the 361 they live. Travel and airport benefits carry the card's value proposition, but less than a quarter of member wallet sits in lifestyle categories. The rest in dining, retail, mobility, health, earns points but unlocks nothing. Perks like golf go unredeemed for structural reasons, not disinterest. And with no view of what's left on the card, members can't see the value they've already paid for.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [61]
>>
